Clan: Commands
--------------

Available to the entire MUD:
cwar <#>          -- Look at information from wars that have already ended.
cwar list            The information accessed via this command is deleted
                     over time. Older wars vanish after awhile, etc.
clans             -- List the available clans on Darkwind.
claninfo <clan>   -- Read information about a particular clan.
who <clan>        -- See who is logged on from a particular clan.
wclan             -- Show all clan members logged on, sorted by clan reputation.
wclan leader      -- Show all clan leaders logged on, sorted by clan reputation.


Available to anyone in a clan:
cl/ecl <msg>      -- Talk/emote on your clan channel.
clhist            -- Display clan channel history.
clwho             -- See who is logged in from your clan.
cstat             -- See statistics about your clan.
clleave           -- Leave your clan.
clemote           -- Clan emote. Works on channels like normal emotes.
                     Leaders can talk to James to have the emote customized 
                     for their clan.
cvote             -- Vote on outstanding clan issue (listed in cstat).
checkclan         -- Check if you have unread message on your clan board.


Available to clan members while in the Clan Operations Room:
cdeposit <coins>  -- Deposit money into clan coffers.
cwithdraw <coins> -- Withdraw money from clan coffers.
cbalance          -- Show the number of coins currently in the coffers.


Available to clan leaders:
leadercmds        -- List all your leader-only commands.
cinitiate         -- Add someone to your clan.
cdismiss          -- Dismiss someone from your clan.
cdeclare          -- Ask a clan leader if he/she wants to start a war.
changedesc        -- Change description of a room in clan headquarters.
                     Can only be used while in one of the rooms.
cdescribe         -- Change the information shown in 'claninfo'
caddissue         -- Add issue for members to vote on.
cdelissue         -- Remove outstanding issue, preventing additional votes.
ctithe            -- Set your clan automatic tithe amount.

Please see "help clans" for a basic overview.
Please see "help clans_basics" for a more detailed intro to clans.
Please see "help clans_war" for warfare information.
